+	2026-10-24  Tamar Christina  <tamar.christina@arm.com>
+
+	* config/aarch64/driver-aarch64.cc (DEFAULT_ARCH, DEFAULT_CPU):
+	Remove.
+	(get_cpu_from_ext): New function.  Select a generic CPU using
+	SVE2 and extensions that depend on it.
